{"speciesId":435,"names":{"fr":"Moufflair","es":"Skuntank","en":"Skuntank","ja":"スカタンク"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It sprays a vile-smelling fluid from the tip of its tail to attack. Its range is over 160 feet."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It sprays a stinky fluid from its tail. The fluid smells worse the longer it is allowed to fester."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It attacks by spraying a horribly smelly fluid from the tip of its tail. Attacks from above confound it."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It attacks by spraying a repugnant fluid from its tail, but the stench dulls after a few squirts."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It attacks by spraying a repugnant fluid from its tail, but the stench dulls after a few squirts."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il attaque en projetant un liquide fétide du bout de sa queue. Mieux vaut l’attaquer par les airs."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It attacks by spraying a horribly smelly fluid from the tip of its tail. Attacks from above confound it."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il attaque en projetant un liquide fétide du bout de sa queue. Mieux vaut l’attaquer par les airs."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It attacks by spraying a horribly smelly fluid from the tip of its tail. Attacks from above confound it."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It attacks by spraying a horribly smelly fluid from the tip of its tail. Attacks from above confound it."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It attacks by spraying a horribly smelly fluid from the tip of its tail. Attacks from above confound it."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il attaque en projetant un liquide fétide du bout de sa queue. Il peut tirer à 50 m."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Para atacar, emite un fluido maloliente por la punta de su cola que puede llegar a más de 50 m."},{"lan